Description: make the fragment shader valid GLSL
 The shader relied on the leniency of the nvidia compiler: implicit int to
 float conversions, float assigned to vec4, int assigned to vec3 and a
 global initialized from gl_Color. Mesa (Intel, AMD, llvmpipe) refused
 to compile it and only the red glColor() fade was drawn. Float literals
 and explicit constructors are used instead, and t is set in main().
 The computation is unchanged.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-12
